From: timfox <timfox@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:12:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Lost Coast: npc_fisherman as monster_lc_fisherman (intro
 scene, lead, look)

Runs what the map and game data ask of the fisherman, baked by
lostcoast-gc tools/bake_lostcoast_actors.py:
- waits on the jetty until the player enters the trigger that starts
  lcs_fisherman_intro, then plays that .vcd timeline: speak (voice via
  the game's soundscripts), lookat, face, moveto !player within 70
- OnCompletion ai_goal_lead: A* over Source's AI node graph (.ain, human
  ground links) to the goal marker, waits beyond LeadDistance, comes back
  for the player (Retrieve) with the talker's LeadComingBack/LeadRetrieve
  scenes, faces the marker's yaw at the end
- looks at the player through Source's head_yaw/head_pitch/spine_yaw/
  body_yaw pose params, baked as GoldSrc bone controllers 0..3
- lcscenetest in gamecube.cfg starts the scene for probes with no player
  at the controls
---
 dlls/lostcoast_npcs.cpp | 817 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 817 insertions(+)

